{{!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     members/subscribe.hbs — THE newsletter signup form. There is one.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     Before this partial the theme carried five hand-rolled copies of the same
     form (home hero, training index, training post, the CTA band, the blog
     sidebar), each with slightly different markup and all five with the same
     bug: a spinner and success/error messages that nothing ever revealed. The
     state machine now lives in 2-components/subscribe.css and the markup lives
     here, so fixing one fixes all of them.

     Params — every one optional:
       layout   "inline" (default) fuses field + button into one pill, for
                heroes and sidebars. "stacked" gives the field a visible label
                and a full-width button, for a newsletter band that has room.
       tone     "dark" when the surface underneath is brand-900 / navy.
       cta      button label.            Default: "Subscribe"
       icon     an icons.hbs name for the button.
       note     fine print under the form. Pass note=false to drop it.
       ok       success message.         Default: check your inbox
       err      error message.
       label    the field label (stacked layout only).
       place    input placeholder.

     MEMBER-AWARE. A signed-in reader is already on the list, so they get a
     confirmation and a link to their account instead of a field asking for the
     address Ghost already has. Pass ask=true to force the form anyway — the
     home hero does, because there the form is the page's primary action and an
     empty space where it was reads as a broken hero.

     PORTAL FALLBACK. With members disabled in Ghost Admin there is no endpoint
     to post to, so the form is replaced by the Portal signup link rather than
     rendering a control that silently fails.
     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}

{{#unless @site.members_enabled}}
  <a href="#/portal/signup" data-portal="signup" class="ns-btn {{#match tone "dark"}}ns-btn--white{{else}}ns-btn--primary{{/match}} ns-btn--lg">
    {{#if icon}}{{> icons name=icon}}{{/if}}{{#if cta}}{{cta}}{{else}}{{t "Subscribe"}}{{/if}}
  </a>
{{else}}

  <div class="ns-subscribe {{#match layout "stacked"}}ns-subscribe--stacked{{else}}ns-subscribe--inline{{/match}}{{#match tone "dark"}} ns-subscribe--dark{{/match}}">

    {{#if @member}}
      {{#if ask}}
        {{> "members/subscribe-form" layout=layout tone=tone cta=cta icon=icon note=note ok=ok err=err label=label place=place}}
      {{else}}
        {{!-- Already signed in — confirm, don't re-ask. --}}
        <p class="ns-subscribe__known">
          {{> icons name="check-circle"}}
          <span>
            {{t "You're subscribed as"}} <strong>{{@member.email}}</strong> ·
            <a href="#/portal/account" data-portal="account" class="font-semibold underline">{{t "manage"}}</a>
          </span>
        </p>
      {{/if}}
    {{else}}
      {{> "members/subscribe-form" layout=layout tone=tone cta=cta icon=icon note=note ok=ok err=err label=label place=place}}
    {{/if}}
  </div>

{{/unless}}
